---
import FunnelLayout from "../layouts/FunnelLayout.astro";
const tracking = {"browserEvent":"ViewContent","serverEvent":"Lead","stepKey":"landing","path":"/landing"};
---
<FunnelLayout title="Landing" description="Paid ad landing page" tracking={tracking}>
<section class="section section-hero pf-section-73-65-63-74-69-6f-6e-2d-6c-61-6e-64-69-6e-67-2d-68-65-72-6f" data-section-id="section-landing-hero"><div class="row pf-row-72-6f-77-2d-6c-61-6e-64-69-6e-67-2d-68-65-72-6f" data-row-id="row-landing-hero"><div class="column pf-column-63-6f-6c-2d-6c-61-6e-64-69-6e-67-2d-68-65-72-6f" data-column-id="col-landing-hero"><h1 class="funnel-element pf-element-65-6c-2d-6c-61-6e-64-69-6e-67-2d-68-65-61-64-69-6e-67" data-block-id="el-landing-heading">See today&#39;s special offer</h1>
<p class="funnel-element pf-element-65-6c-2d-6c-61-6e-64-69-6e-67-2d-74-65-78-74" data-block-id="el-landing-text">A complete generic paid-ad funnel. No fabricated customer quotes.</p>
<a class="funnel-element pf-element-65-6c-2d-6c-61-6e-64-69-6e-67-2d-63-74-61 funnel-button" data-block-id="el-landing-cta" data-funnel-link data-destination="/form" href="/form">Get started</a></div></div></section>
<section class="section section-two-column pf-section-73-65-63-74-69-6f-6e-2d-6c-61-6e-64-69-6e-67-2d-73-70-6c-69-74" data-section-id="section-landing-split"><div class="row pf-row-72-6f-77-2d-6c-61-6e-64-69-6e-67-2d-73-70-6c-69-74" data-row-id="row-landing-split"><div class="column pf-column-63-6f-6c-2d-6c-61-6e-64-69-6e-67-2d-69-6d-61-67-65" data-column-id="col-landing-image"><div class="funnel-element pf-element-65-6c-2d-6c-61-6e-64-69-6e-67-2d-69-6d-61-67-65 media-placeholder" data-block-id="el-landing-image">Upload an image</div></div>
<div class="column pf-column-63-6f-6c-2d-6c-61-6e-64-69-6e-67-2d-62-65-6e-65-66-69-74-73" data-column-id="col-landing-benefits"><ul class="funnel-element pf-element-65-6c-2d-6c-61-6e-64-69-6e-67-2d-6c-69-73-74" data-block-id="el-landing-list"><li>Local delivery</li><li>In-stock models</li><li>Financing options</li></ul></div></div></section>
<section class="section section-cta pf-section-73-65-63-74-69-6f-6e-2d-6c-61-6e-64-69-6e-67-2d-63-74-61" data-section-id="section-landing-cta"><div class="row pf-row-72-6f-77-2d-6c-61-6e-64-69-6e-67-2d-63-74-61" data-row-id="row-landing-cta"><div class="column pf-column-63-6f-6c-2d-6c-61-6e-64-69-6e-67-2d-63-74-61" data-column-id="col-landing-cta"><a class="funnel-element pf-element-65-6c-2d-6c-61-6e-64-69-6e-67-2d-70-68-6f-6e-65 funnel-button" data-block-id="el-landing-phone" data-funnel-link data-destination="/form" href="/form">Call now</a></div></div></section>
<section class="section section-footer pf-section-73-65-63-74-69-6f-6e-2d-6c-61-6e-64-69-6e-67-2d-66-6f-6f-74-65-72" data-section-id="section-landing-footer"><div class="row pf-row-72-6f-77-2d-6c-61-6e-64-69-6e-67-2d-66-6f-6f-74-65-72" data-row-id="row-landing-footer"><div class="column pf-column-63-6f-6c-2d-6c-61-6e-64-69-6e-67-2d-66-6f-6f-74-65-72" data-column-id="col-landing-footer"><p class="funnel-element pf-element-65-6c-2d-6c-61-6e-64-69-6e-67-2d-66-6f-6f-74-65-72" data-block-id="el-landing-footer">Paid ads funnel fixture</p></div></div></section>
<section class="section section-image-choice-hero pf-section-69-6e-73-5f-37" data-section-id="ins_7"><div class="row pf-row-69-6e-73-5f-36" data-row-id="ins_6"><div class="column pf-column-69-6e-73-5f-35" data-column-id="ins_5"><h1 class="funnel-element pf-element-69-6e-73-5f-31" data-block-id="ins_1">An Easier Way to Get What You Need</h1>
<p class="funnel-element pf-element-69-6e-73-5f-32" data-block-id="ins_2">No appointments. No obligation. Free to apply.</p>
<div class="funnel-element pf-element-69-6e-73-5f-33 media-placeholder" data-block-id="ins_3">Upload an image</div>
<div class="funnel-element pf-element-69-6e-73-5f-34 survey-question" style="--choice-columns:2;--choice-gap:18px;--choice-background:#2ba4ee;--choice-color:#ffffff;--choice-radius:4px" data-block-id="ins_4" data-survey-question data-field="offerChoice" data-destination="/form" data-auto-advance="true">
<p class="survey-question-label">Which option fits you best?</p>
<button type="button" class="choice" data-answer="Option one">Option one</button>
<button type="button" class="choice" data-answer="Option two">Option two</button>
</div></div></div></section>
<section class="section section-numbered-steps pf-section-69-6e-73-5f-32-32" data-section-id="ins_22"><div class="row pf-row-69-6e-73-5f-32-30" data-row-id="ins_20"><div class="column pf-column-69-6e-73-5f-31-39" data-column-id="ins_19"><h2 class="funnel-element pf-element-69-6e-73-5f-31-37" data-block-id="ins_17">The Smart Way Forward</h2>
<p class="funnel-element pf-element-69-6e-73-5f-31-38" data-block-id="ins_18">Describe the process, then customize each step card below.</p></div></div>
<div class="row pf-row-69-6e-73-5f-32-31" data-row-id="ins_21"><div class="column pf-column-69-6e-73-5f-31-30" data-column-id="ins_10"><h3 class="funnel-element pf-element-69-6e-73-5f-38" data-block-id="ins_8">1 · Get Started</h3>
<p class="funnel-element pf-element-69-6e-73-5f-39" data-block-id="ins_9">Explain the first action customers should take.</p></div>
<div class="column pf-column-69-6e-73-5f-31-33" data-column-id="ins_13"><h3 class="funnel-element pf-element-69-6e-73-5f-31-31" data-block-id="ins_11">2 · Shop With Confidence</h3>
<p class="funnel-element pf-element-69-6e-73-5f-31-32" data-block-id="ins_12">Explain how your process makes the decision easier.</p></div>
<div class="column pf-column-69-6e-73-5f-31-36" data-column-id="ins_16"><h3 class="funnel-element pf-element-69-6e-73-5f-31-34" data-block-id="ins_14">3 · Choose Your Best Option</h3>
<p class="funnel-element pf-element-69-6e-73-5f-31-35" data-block-id="ins_15">Explain the final step and expected outcome.</p></div></div></section>
</FunnelLayout>
